                                </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2434885\">\n                                            <p>展开</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2434885\">\n                                            <p>收起</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-id=\"2433537\">\n                                    <P data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2433537&articletype=ordinary\" data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\">\n                                                <section>英大期货从此新归属，中石油11.29亿拿下100%股权，公司新名有了？</section>\n                                    </P>\n        \n                                <div data-time=\"\">\n                                                    <p><img src=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/iav/original.png\">\n                                                            <span>财联社记者 周晓雅</span>\n                                                        <span>2026-07-22 11:53</span>\n                                                    </p>\n                                                </div>\n        \n                                <section>\n                                                <pre>①中油资本收购，意在进一步深化产投融一体协同，增强在能源化工领域的综合金融服务能力；\n                                    ②英大期货的股权出售，跟国网英大的股权划转同步进行；\n                                    ③随着新一轮股权变更落地，英大期货或迎来发展新机遇。</pre>\n                                            </section>\n        \n                                <div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p>70.2w+ 阅读</p>\n                                            <div data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\" data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2433537&articletype=ordinary\">\n                                                \n                                                    <p>3</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\" data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2433537&articletype=ordinary\">\n                                                \n                                                    <p>106</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2433537\">\n                                            <p>展开</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                    <div data-id=\"2433537\">\n                                            <p>收起</p>\n                                            \n                                        </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-id=\"2397533\">\n                                    <P data-openapplink=\"cailianpressopen://open?articleid=2397533&articletype=ordinary\" data-href=\"https://sj.qq.com/appdetail/com.lanjinger.choiassociatedpress\">\n                                                <section>多晶硅期货“底部躁动”今日大涨 业内预计出清传闻短期难改基本面</section>\n                                    </P>\n        \n                                <div data-time=\"\">\n                                                    <p><img src=\"https://cdnjs.cls.cn/iav/original.png\">\n                                                            <span>财联社记者 刘梦然</span>\n                                                        <span>2026-06-11 20:32</span>\n                                                    </p>\n                    